OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FLow cloud and hill fog lifting
OL,6,Fon Thursday morning to leave a mostly
OL,7,Fdry day with some sunshine, especially
OL,8,Fin the southeast. However, cloud will
OL,9,Fincrease during the afternoon, with
OL,10,Fpatchy rain developing in the north. A
OL,11,Fwarm, humid day.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FEarly evening bright spells
OL,14,Fwill give way to thickening cloud and
OL,15,Frain from the northwest during the
OL,16,Fevening and overnight. Some of the
OL,17,Frain turning heavy. Staying warm and
OL,18,Fhumid.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
