OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FA wet start with some heavy
OL,6,Frain around, though brightening up
OL,7,Ffrom the northwest through the morning
OL,8,Fto leave a fine afternoon. Breezy, and
OL,9,Ffeeling fresher than recently.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,12,FSaturday looks mainly dry with some
OL,13,Fsunshine and fairly gentle winds.
OL,14,FGradually turning wet and windy from
OL,15,Fthe northwest on Sunday, ahead of
OL,16,Fbrighter skies again on Monday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
